{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48815","headline":"曲龙山歌 一 · 顾况","name":"曲龙山歌 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曲龙丈人冠藕花，其颜色映光明砂。\n玉绳金枝有通籍，五岳三山如一家。\n遥指丛霄呇灵岛，岛中晔晔无凡草。\n九仙傲倪折五芝，翠凤白麟回异道。\n石台石镜月长明，石洞石桥连上清。\n人间妻子见不识，拍云挥手升天行。\n摩天截汉何潇洒，四石五云更上下。\n下方小兆更拜焉，愿得骑云作车马。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48815.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48815","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}